### Back-office requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client). Start choco-admin first (dev profile).

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Sign in
# @name login
POST {{host}}/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin@12345" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### Who am I, and which menus may I open?
GET {{host}}/admin/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Today's numbers and what needs attention
GET {{host}}/report/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Which products earn money? (revenue minus ingredients, packaging, labour and fees)
GET {{host}}/report/contribution?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Core products that are live
GET {{host}}/product/list?launchTier=CORE&published=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Price minus costs, per unit
GET {{host}}/product/1/contribution
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Plan and release a production batch (controls: allergen check, temper test, best-before)
POST {{host}}/production/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantityUnits": 120, "processCode": "M11" }

###
POST {{host}}/production/1/release
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "allergenChecked": true, "temperTestPassed": true, "bestBefore": "2026-11-15", "wasteUnits": 6 }

### Brand directory: the shortlisted brands in the sampling stage
GET {{host}}/brand/list?stockingStatus=SAMPLING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The launch playbook and its progress
GET {{host}}/guide/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/guide/list?type=SALES_LAUNCH&phase=Launch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Orders waiting to be prepared
GET {{host}}/order/list?status=PREPARING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
